{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>A covering for the tent.</b> For that roof of goats' hair curtains — make yet another covering of reddened rams' skins, and yet another above it of tahash skins. And those coverings covered only the roof — their length 30 and their width 10. These are the words of Rabbi Nechemiah; and according to Rabbi Yehudah there was one covering — half of reddened rams' skins and half of tahash skins (Shabbat 28)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:44.189463150Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}